This license has two parts:

  Part 1 governs the PassCode source code (the "Software"): the contents
  of the src/, build_tools/ directories, and other project configuration
  files.

  Part 2 governs the quiz content (the "Content"): the questions, answers,
  explanations, and media files (images, videos) located in the assets/
  directory. The Content originates from a third-party public source and
  is NOT owned by the PassCode Contributors. Part 2 applies regardless of
  Part 1, including to any copy, fork, or redistribution of this
  repository, even where the Software is itself modified or redistributed
  under Part 1.

