PART 2 — QUIZ CONTENT (additional terms)
================================================================================

1. ORIGIN AND OWNERSHIP

The Content is taken from the "Je repasse le code" quiz, published by:
  French Government — Délégation à la sécurité routière (road safety
  delegation)
  Source: https://www.securite-routiere.gouv.fr/les-medias/nos-quiz/je-repasse-le-code

Rights to the Content belong to its original publisher. PassCode is not
developed, edited, or endorsed by this organization.

2. LEGAL STATUS: UNDER CLARIFICATION

This project initially assumed the Content was covered by the French
"Licence Ouverte 2.0" (Open Licence), which allows free reuse with simple
attribution. This assumption has proven uncertain: the Content may in fact
be protected by standard copyright, without automatic free reuse rights.

A request for reuse authorization has been sent to the Délégation à la
sécurité routière. Until an official response is obtained:

  - The exact legal status of the Content remains uncertain.
  - This repository should not be considered to have confirmed
    authorization to reuse the Content.
  - No release (executable, installer) of PassCode is published.
  - This section will be updated upon receiving a response
    (authorization, refusal, or specific conditions).

3. NO MODIFICATION

The Content (questions, answers, explanations, media) MUST NOT be
modified, altered, adapted, translated, or extended (e.g. adding new
questions) in any form. It must be kept and redistributed strictly
identical to its original version.

This restriction applies fully to any copy, fork, or redistribution of
this repository, including where the Software is itself modified, adapted,
or redistributed under the terms of Part 1. The right to modify the
Software under Part 1 does not, under any circumstance, grant any right to
modify the Content, even partially.

4. ATTRIBUTION

Any redistribution of the Content must credit:
  © French Government — Délégation à la sécurité routière
  Source: https://www.securite-routiere.gouv.fr

5. PROHIBITED USES

  - Any malicious or misleading use.
